OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPartly
OL,6,Fcloudy with any lingering showers
OL,7,Feasing and a frost developing in
OL,8,Fplaces. Cloud builds in with
OL,9,Fpersistent, locally heavy, rain
OL,10,Fdeveloping and reaching all parts by
OL,11,Fmorning. Sleet and snow likely over
OL,12,Fhigh ground. Becoming breezy and
OL,13,Ffeeling cold.
OL,14,
OL,15,CTuesday:FA cloudy, cold and wet day
OL,16,Fwith persistent rain and some strong
OL,17,Fwinds. Sleet or snow continuing to
OL,18,Ffall on hills until late morning with
OL,19,Fsome accumulations possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
